  "description": "Stylised voices for effect: telephone, AM radio, megaphone and a deep movie-trailer announcer. Heads up — the ATEM has no distortion or saturation, so the telephone/AM/megaphone chains are the band-limiting and the honk only, not the grit. Each preset says so in its notes. Great fun on a caller, remote guest or announcer channel.",
